OL,3,CThe unsolved mystery of the schoolgirl
OL,4,Cwho disappeared in the summer of 1979
OL,6,FThe sister of a schoolgirl who has
OL,7,Fbeen missing for almost 50 years said
OL,8,Fshe had 'never been forgotten' as she
OL,9,Fmade a new appeal for information to
OL,10,Ftry to solve the case.
OL,12,FSuzanne Lawrence, aged 14 at the time,
OL,13,Fwas reported missing in the summer of
OL,14,F1979. She left home in Harold Hill on
OL,15,F27 July 1979 with her then 13-year-old
OL,16,Fsister Michelle.
OL,18,FThe pair told their mother they would
OL,19,Fbe staying with friends in Dagenham.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
