PN,37402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785763121
OL,3,CThe unsolved mystery of the schoolgirl
OL,4,Cwho disappeared in the summer of 1979
OL,6,FMichelle returned home a few days
OL,7,Flater after the pair had an argument.
OL,8,FShe told police they met three boys,
OL,9,Faged around 14 to 17, at a fair in
OL,10,FHighbury Fields.
OL,12,FThe boys took them to a nearby squat,
OL,13,Fbut she was unable to find the address
OL,14,Fwhen she accompanied officers on a
OL,15,Fvisit to the area.
OL,17,FAt the time police thought Suzanne may
OL,18,Fhave joined a travelling fair.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785763121
OL,3,CThe unsolved mystery of the schoolgirl
OL,4,Cwho disappeared in the summer of 1979
OL,6,FThe case has never been closed and
OL,7,Fdetectives are appealing for any
OL,8,Finformation that could help find out
OL,9,Fwhat what happened to the schoolgirl.
OL,11,FOfficers are keeping an open mind over
OL,12,Fthe circumstances of Suzanne's
OL,13,Fdisappearance, including whether she
OL,14,Fmay have come to harm.
OL,16,FDetectives have also prepared two e-
OL,17,Ffit images of how Suzanne, who would
OL,18,Fnow be aged 61, may look now.
OL,20,FThe officers continue to support
OL,21,FSuzanne's family.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785763121
OL,3,CThe unsolved mystery of the schoolgirl
OL,4,Cwho disappeared in the summer of 1979
OL,6,FHer sister Michelle Hooper, who is
OL,7,Fsupporting the police appeal, said: "I
OL,8,Fwas the last member of the family to
OL,9,Fbe with my sister before she
OL,10,Fdisappeared.
OL,12,F"We left home together and for a
OL,13,Fperiod we were both trying to survive
OL,14,Faway from home. Eventually I returned,
OL,15,Fbut Suzanne did not.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785763121
OL,3,CThe unsolved mystery of the schoolgirl
OL,4,Cwho disappeared in the summer of 1979
OL,6,F"Many years have passed, but not a day
OL,7,Fgoes by without wondering what
OL,8,Fhappened to her. Our mother is now
OL,9,Felderly and, like me, has lived for
OL,10,Fdecades without knowing what became of
OL,11,Fher daughter. No family should have to
OL,12,Fendure such uncertainty for so long.
OL,14,F"If anyone remembers seeing us,
OL,15,Fhelping us, giving us somewhere to
OL,16,Fstay, or speaking to my sister during
OL,17,Fthose days in the summer of 1979,
OL,18,Fplease come forward. Even the smallest
OL,19,Fpiece of information could be
OL,20,Fimportant.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785763121
OL,3,CThe unsolved mystery of the schoolgirl
OL,4,Cwho disappeared in the summer of 1979
OL,6,F"If my sister is alive, I want her to
OL,7,Fknow that she has never been
OL,8,Fforgotten. If anyone knows what
OL,9,Fhappened to her, I ask them to do the
OL,10,Fright thing and speak to the police.
OL,11,FOur family simply wants the truth and
OL,12,Fthe opportunity to finally understand
OL,13,Fwhat happened."
OL,15,FDetective Chief Inspector Kam Sodhi,
OL,16,Fwho is leading the Met's
OL,17,Finvestigation, added: "We're committed
OL,18,Fto getting answers for Suzanne's
OL,19,Ffamily, even after all these years.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785763121
OL,3,CThe unsolved mystery of the schoolgirl
OL,4,Cwho disappeared in the summer of 1979
OL,6,F"After they left the family home,
OL,7,FSuzanne and her younger sibling are
OL,8,Fbelieved to have experienced a brief
OL,9,Fperiod of homelessness.
OL,11,F"During that period, we believe that
OL,12,Fthree boys aged approximately 14 to 17
OL,13,Fyears, believed to be from the
OL,14,FHighbury or Islington area, met the
OL,15,Fsisters and took them to a local squat.
OL,17,F"I believe these individuals may hold
OL,18,Fvital information about Suzanne's
OL,19,Fmovements after her sister returned
OL,20,Fhome and I would urge them to come
OL,21,Fforward.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785763121
OL,3,CThe unsolved mystery of the schoolgirl
OL,4,Cwho disappeared in the summer of 1979
OL,6,F"We are also particularly interested
OL,7,Fin hearing from anyone who knew the
OL,8,Ffamily, attended school with Suzanne,
OL,9,Fhelped either child, or had any
OL,10,Fcontact with them during the summer of
OL,11,F1979.
OL,13,F"Relationships and circumstances
OL,14,Fchange over time. Information that may
OL,15,Fonce have seemed insignificant could
OL,16,Fnow be vital to finding answers for
OL,17,Fher family.
OL,19,F"Someone knows what happened to
OL,20,FSuzanne. If you have any information,
OL,21,Fhowever small, please contact us.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785763121
OL,3,CThe unsolved mystery of the schoolgirl
OL,4,Cwho disappeared in the summer of 1979
OL,6,F"I'd also appeal to Suzanne herself,
OL,7,Fif she is reading this, to get in
OL,8,Ftouch with us."
OL,10,FSuzanne is described as a white girl,
OL,11,Fwith dark brown straight hair, who was
OL,12,Faround 5'3" to 5'5" in height and of
OL,13,Fslim build. She spoke with a local,
OL,14,FEssex accent.
OL,16,FAnyone with information is asked to
OL,17,Fcontact police by calling 101, quoting
OL,18,FOp Examen and the reference 01/1106320/
OL,19,F24.
OL,26,@tD@KO]tD@SO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/10
