OL,3,CThe unsolved mystery of the schoolgirl
OL,4,Cwho disappeared in the summer of 1979
OL,6,FInformation can also be provided
OL,7,Fanonymously by calling Crimestoppers
OL,8,Fon 0800 555 111.
